   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2024 GRANT-ENHANCE NATIONAL CAPACITY FOR EMERGENCY PREPAREDNESS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to strengthen Zambia&#x2019;s capacities in public health emergency preparedness, surveillance and response to priority diseases, conditions and events that include COVID-19. This will ensure improved implementation of routine surveillance and response while maintaining the continuity of essential health service delivery, laboratory diagnostic services, health services continuity monitoring, and coordination and collaboration across sectors within the One Health arrangement.</narrative>
